{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00826","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 咸顺 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 咸顺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万舞咸列，三阶克清。\n贯珠一倡，击石九成。\n盈觞虽酌，灵坐无形。\n永怀我祖，达其孝诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}